["19:36"]={
{"The time on the video recorder was \00319:36\004 when the back door slammed and Victor strode into the front room clutching a handful of something so unspeakably vile it defies description.","One Foot in the Grave","David Renwick",true},
},
["19:37"]={
{"A ship is making an unauthorized departure from the main orbital terminal tonight at precisely \00319:37\004 hours. We need to produce a reaction from Orbital Defense which will appear to be a genuine response to an unauthorized seizure of a vessel.","Relic of Empire","W. Michael Gear",true},
},
["19:38"]={
{"Wednesday \0037:38 P.M.\004\n“Michael! And Eva! Again, after so long. Pos iste! What a surprise!” The old Greek’s sunburned face widened into a smile, his gray mustache opening above his last good teeth. “Parakalo, you must come in for a glass of raki and some of Adriana’s meze. She would never forgive me.”","Project Daedalus","Thomas Hoover",true},
},
["19:39"]={
{"At \0037:39\004 the aircraft taxied onto the runway to prepare for takeoff. When it stopped, Dexter asked the flight attendant what was holding them up.","Honor Among Thieves","Jeffrey Archer",true},
{"The time too was speeding on. \003Twenty-one minutes to eight\004! In a few minutes more he must set out or he would miss the train.","The Case of Oscar Brodski","R. Austin Freeman",true},
{"\0037:39 P.M.\004\nEva and Braque made $180 at Jack Cermak’s before complains from the nosy wait staff and whiny-ass sore losers forced them out. Then they made a quick five bucks at the famous Every 1’s A Wiener hot dog stand in Andersonville just for taking a bite from a Fire Dog. Eva actually took two bites, because that’s just who she was.","Kitchens of the Great Midwest","J. Ryan Stradal",false},
},
["19:40"]={
{"They reckon the time was \003twenty to eight\004. They can swear, sir, that the body wasn’t suspended then and that they saw no one on the forecourt.","Original Sin","P.D. James",true},
{"She arrives at \0037:40\004, ten minutes late, but the children, Jimmy and Bitsy, are still eating supper and their parents are not ready to go yet. From other rooms come the sound of a baby screaming, water running, a television musical (no words: probably a dance number — patterns of gliding figures come to mind).","The Babysitter","Robert Coover",true},
},
["19:41"]={
{"LIGHTING-UP TIME WAS \0037:41 P.M.\004 on September 25th. Krantz didn’t appear on the outskirts of Wentworth until just after eight.","False Impression","Jeffrey Archer",true},
