{"At \003five minutes to eight\004, the Prime Minister emerged from Wilson’s office, followed by Halifax and Cadogan. Wilson was the last to appear. He looked irritated. Legat guessed he must have had a further argument with Cadogan.","Munich","Robert Harris",true},
{"Flora drew her coat round her, and looked up into the darkening vault of the sky. Then she glanced at her watch. It was \003five to eight\004.","Cold Comfort Farm","Stella Gibbons",true},
{"The party starts at \003eight, and it’s five to\004.\n“Anything up to half an hour late is considered on time, Pruitt. Don’t you know anything about etiquette?”\n“Very little, I’m afraid”\n“Well, anything up to half an hour late is considered on time, but anything before the appointed time —even a single minute— is downright gouchy.”","Staggerford","Jon Hassler",true},
},
["19:56"]={
{"I remember the cigarette in his hard face, against the now limitless storm cloud. Bernardo cried to him unexpectedly: “What time is it, Ireno?”\nWithout consulting the sky, without stopping, he replied: “It’s \003four minutes to eight\004, young Bernardo Juan Franciso.” His voice was shrill, mocking.","Funes the Memorious-Labyrinths","Jorge Luis Borges",true},
